  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>Z</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>10</mn></math>, let the angle between the plane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math> and the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Now rewriting the equation of line we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Now we know that,&nbsp;</p><p>Angle between plane and line is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#183;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>So, the equation of plane will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now given, distance of point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;from plane is<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><msqrt><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}